Tri-CEA Public Data Repository
Copyright (c) 2026 Tri-CEA Project

Data in this repository is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
You may share and adapt the data for any purpose, with credit to the
Tri-CEA Project. Any code is provided under the MIT License.

Please also note:

- Indigenous data sovereignty is respected. Data from or about tribal
  communities remains under their governance and must not be used to harm
  or misrepresent them.
- Social and survey data are shared only in aggregate. Do not attempt to
  identify individuals.
- Data is shared following FAIR principles. Keep metadata with the data
  when reusing it.
- Please cite the Tri-CEA Project when using this data.
